<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσγελάω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσομαι [ᾰ</span>] <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Pax</u>
			600
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smile
			at</i> one, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				566d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ . . τὰ . . φυτὰ προσγελάσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσγελᾶτε τὸν
				πανύστατον γέλων</span>
			<i>smile</i> your last smile <i>upon</i> me, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1041
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>greet.</i> the senses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσμὴ βροτείων αἱμάτων με προσγελᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					253
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιστὰ γάρ σε προσγελᾷ θεᾶς ἔπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					291
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσγελῶσά τε λοπὰς παφλάζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					109
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				33.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> later c.
			dat., <i>smile upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δούλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					183
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				13.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				48.10
			</span></i>.</div>
